# GLM-4.6V (Zhipu), 107B mixture of experts in FP8 (compressed-tensors). NOT USABLE with transformers
# 5.19: loading converts the FP8 experts and ran out of memory on two H100 (job 28094249), and the
# vision tower's FP8 scales are reported missing. Use zai-org/GLM-4.6V in bf16 on four H100, or
# glm-4.6v-flash (10B dense) on one A100. Kept for reference.
backend: hf
hf_id: zai-org/GLM-4.6V-FP8
dtype: bfloat16
decoding: {temperature: 0.0, max_tokens: 1024}
options:
  attn_implementation: sdpa
notes: Submit with sbatch --partition=gpu_h100 --gpus=2 --cpus-per-task=32. Needs Hopper for FP8.
